<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Gas falls due to domestic CB launch.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Gas falls due to domestic CB launch.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Gas Co Ltd fell to a new low for the year in Friday afternoon trade, depressed by the launch of domestic convertible bonds, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0554 GMT, the shares were down 16 yen at 308 yen, the most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo Stock exchange.</p>
